Package: symmetrichal
Type: Project
Title: The Highly Adaptive Lasso Depends on How You Code Your Covariates
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Gaurav", "Sood", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "gsood07@gmail.com")
Description: Code, collected results and manuscript for a paper showing that
    the zero-order Highly Adaptive Lasso changes its fit when a covariate is
    negated, and that symmetric HAL, which adds the reflected indicators,
    does not.
